entries.description:
Zamu is an Android bulk SMS scheduler built on your rule: every SMS takes the next template, T1 to T5 then back to T1, and each client gets each template once, evenly spaced. All 7 pages: your attachment's planner grid, search/delete by number, last SMS date, bulk edit/delete, sent report with CSV log, forwarding and auto-reply. Ink-black UI, five template colours like your sheet, Plus Jakarta Sans and JetBrains Mono, Swahili sample SMS. You receive the HTML/CSS/JS source of the working prototype with its tested rotation engine, PNG of every screen, the font list and a README with the CSV format. Unlimited revisions, any change (colour, font, layout, text) delivered within a few hours — rate or comment and I will revise.
